sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032","text":"承字仲嗣，少以才學知名，與諸葛瑾、歩騭、嚴畯相友善。權爲驃騎將軍，辟西曹掾，出爲長沙西部都尉。討平山寇，得精兵萬五千人。後爲濡須都督、奮威將軍，封都鄕侯，領部曲五千人。承爲人壯毅忠讜，能甄識人物，拔彭城蔡款、南陽謝景於孤微童幼，後並爲國士，款至衞尉，景豫章太守。又諸葛恪年少時，眾人奇其英才。承言終敗諸葛氏者，元遜也。勤於長進，篤於物類，凡在庶幾之流，無不造門，年六十七，赤烏七年卒，謚曰定侯。子震嗣。初，承喪妻，昭欲爲索諸葛瑾女，承以相與有好，難之，權聞而勸焉，遂爲婿。生女，權爲子和納之。權數令和修敬於承，執子婿之禮。震諸葛恪誅時亦死。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"承","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"仲嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"諸葛瑾","kind":"person","person_id":"lpo_z63_vzb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"歩騭","kind":"person","person_id":"snv_2iq_jes","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"嚴畯","kind":"person","person_id":"szg_rhg_18d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"承","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:l