2-zhangcheng-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036","text":"休字叔嗣，弱冠與諸葛恪、顧譚等俱爲太子登僚友，以《漢書》授登。從中庶子轉爲右弼都尉。權常遊獵，迨幕乃歸，休上疏諫戒，權大善之，以示於昭。及登卒後，爲侍中，拜羽林都督，平三典軍事，遷揚武將軍。爲魯王霸友黨所譖，與顧譚、承俱以芍陂論功事，休、承與典軍陳恂通情，詐增其伐，並徙交州。中書令孫弘佞偽險詖，休素所忿，弘因是譖訴，下詔書賜休死，時年四十一。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"休","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"叔嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"諸葛恪","kind":"person","person_id":"512_1cd_a4b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"顧譚","kind":"person","person_id":"syc_ik6_bq5_**AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子登","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"登","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"休","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_A","status":"contextu